180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (VidSnapAI is an innovative AI-powered SaaS platform that automates the creation of short-form social media videos such as TikToks and Instagram Reels using user-provided images and text descriptions. The platform simplifies the content creation process by integrating advanced voice synthesis and automated video editing, eliminating the need for manual post-production. Built on a Python Flask backend, VidSnapAI enables users to upload images and text, which are processed through the ElevenLabs API to generate natural-sounding voiceovers using cutting-edge text-to-speech \(TTS\) technology. The FFmpeg media toolkit then compiles the images into a vertical 9:16 video format, synchronizing them with the synthesized audio to produce a polished, ready-to-share video. The completed videos are displayed in a web-based gallery, allowing users to preview, download, or instantly share their creations. Designed with a mobile-first approach, VidSnapAI ensures seamless compatibility with smartphone screens and major social media platforms. By combining AI-driven audio generation and automated video assembly, the platform offers a fast, user-friendly, and professional-grade solution for digital creators, marketers, and educators seeking efficient and scalable media production workflows.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
