/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (In the modern digital era, social media platforms like TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts have revolutionized the way users create and consume content. Short-form videos have become the most engaging medium for communication, marketing, and entertainment. However, creating such videos manually requires considerable time, technical skill, and creativity. Tasks such as scripting, recording voiceovers, editing visuals, and synchronizing audio are often challenging for non- professional users. To overcome these challenges, VidSnapAI has been developed as an AI-powered system that automates the creation of TikTok and Reel-style videos. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
