246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (To overcome these challenges, VidSnapAI aims to develop an AI-driven web application that automatically converts user-provided text and images into short, platform-ready videos. By integrating ElevenLabs for realistic AI-based text-to-speech conversion and FFmpeg for automated video compilation, the system eliminates manual editing and recording steps. The project seeks to empower content creators by simplifying video production through automation, enabling faster turnaround, consistent quality, and greater accessibility for non-technical users. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
