251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (The scope of VidSnapAI covers the automation of TikTok/Reel style video production from start to finish. The system will take user input \(text script or media\) and produce a finalized video with AI- generated voiceover. It will include core modules for text-to-speech, video assembly, and a user interface. The project focuses on short video creation and does not cover advanced editing features like complex visual effects or multi-language translation beyond English. The intended users are content creators and businesses who need quick video turnaround. Limitations include reliance on the quality of AI tools \(voiceover clarity, video assets available\) and constraints of running on standard computing hardware. Future extensions could add more languages, templates, or integration with social platform )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
