/E (Overall, VidSnapAI reflects current trends in AI-assisted content creation, where automation, accessibility, and personalization converge. By integrating natural language processing, speech synthesis, and multimedia automation, VidSnapAI exemplifies the next generation of smart media production tools. Its development contributes to ongoing research in human-computer interaction, creative automation, and digital media technologies aimed at enhancing productivity for creators, marketers, and educators.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
